\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>The coin halberd charges, piercing its foes and pushing them back 2 m / 7 ft. </dd>\n\n<ul><li><dl></dl></li></ul>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pierce\" title=\"Pierce\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pierce\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Generic_Physical_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pierce\" title=\"Pierce\">Pierce</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>The coin halberd pierces its opponent with gleaming precision. </dd>\n\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/w